  "description": {
    "sub_id3": null,
    "sub_name": "財務報表分析",
    "sub_ename": "FINANCIAL STATEMENT ANALYSIS",
    "describe_ch": "本課程的目的提升學生使用財務資訊的能力並增加學生分析企業的知識。我們會介紹和會計與財務的相關分析工具，幫助我們理解財務報告所包含的資訊與如何使用這些資訊於企業分析的程序上。",
    "describe_eh": "The purpose of this class is to advance students' competence of how to use financial information and to add students' knowledge of how to analyze firms. We will introduce the analysis tools relating to accounting & finance to help us understand what is contained in financial reports, and how to use the information for the business analysis procedure.\r\n",
